# Used by Cloudflare Pages (GitHub Pages ignores this file — there, the
# prerendered /concepts page redirects in the browser instead).
#
# /concepts was the design gallery's address before it was archived at /v2.
# Cloudflare preserves the query string across a redirect, so deep links like
# /concepts?c=almanac keep landing on the right concept.
/concepts /v2 301

# /v3 names the version that is currently live at /. It redirects rather than
# 404ing, and becomes a sealed snapshot on the day v3 is superseded — at which
# point this line goes and the address keeps resolving to the same thing.
/v3 / 301
